The '''Qymish Security Service''' ([[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⱒⰺⰿⰰⱜⰰ Ⰱⰾⰰⰶⱆⱂ Ⱜⰰⱃⱀⰺⰱⰰ, ''Qymaja Blazhup Jarnyba''; '''QBJ''') is a [[Qym]]ish government agency organized under the [[Royal Ministry of Public Safety (Qym)|Royal Ministry of Public Safety]]. It operates as a [[wikipedia:security agency|security agency]] responsible for counter-espionage, counter-terrorism, as well as the protection of dignitaries and the [[Qymish royal family|royal family]]. 

